311-339\",\"packages/cli-communication-projection/src/clients/types.ts:18-105\",\"packages/cli-communication-projection/src/fidelity/semantics.ts:61-107\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-12T21:18:00.000Z\",\"durationMs\":120000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q-architecture\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"architecture choice\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-raw-text-payload\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"raw-text payload\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-hybrid-fit\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"hybrid skeleton + slots\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"from\":\"f-hybrid-fit\",\"to\":\"q-architecture\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"}]}\nEOF\necho ok"},"output":"ok\n","metadata":{"output":"ok\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cat >> \"specs/sk-doc/028-sk-communication-skill/research/lineages/deepseek/deep-research-state.jsonl\" << 'EOF'\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":4,\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"run\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Architecture — local primitive vs structured/templated/semantic-diff/hybrid\",\"focusTrack\":\"architecture\",\"findingsCount\":6,\"newInfoRatio\":0.72,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Pinning the raw-text payload plus canonical-reference-only Codex mapping plus Codex-as-the-only-full-projection-path evidence turns the architecture debate into a concrete hybrid recommendation with a safe first tier.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Is local-tokenize -> model -> local-restore the right architecture, or would structured/templated rendering, semantic diffing, or a hybrid produce better readable and safe output?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"The primitive is the right security boundary but whole-message projection is the wrong granularity; a hybrid deterministic skeleton plus bounded prose slots is the best fit; semantic diff is a safety gate, not a renderer; Codex is the only full-projection path.\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Replacing local restoration with remote structured rendering\",\"Assuming event kind alone supports universal templates\",\"Using semantic diff as a readability generator\"],\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"packages/cli-communication-projection/src/contracts/event.ts:23-46,52-87\",\"packages/cli-communication-projection/src/core/assembly-output.ts:25-113\",\"packages/cli-communication-projection/src/core/assembler.ts:122-260\",\"packages/cli-communication-projection/src/runtimes/codex.ts:116-135,271-294,311-339\",\"packages/cli-communication-projection/src/clients/types.ts:18-105\",\"packages/cli-communication-projection/src/fidelity/semantics.ts:61-107\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-12T21:18:00.000Z\",\"durationMs\":120000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q-architecture\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"architecture choice\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-raw-text-payload\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"raw-text payload\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-hybrid-fit\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"hybrid skeleton + slots\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"from\":\"f-hybrid-fit\",\"to\":\"q-architecture\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"}]}\nEOF\necho ok","time":{"start":1786569399261,"end":1786569399263}},"id":"prt_ff7d5775e001V1RKtlc6na7mhV","sessionID":"ses_00832c111ffe8md0OBtHNejm4h","messageID":"msg_ff7d56724001SgM3L48tKr0XT1"}}
